# Development-only, kept on disk but never shipped: harness/ holds the scenario
# runner, the scenarios, their fixture maps and the headless checks. Nothing in
# the game imports it. HARNESS.md documents how to use the shipped game as an SDK
# and deliberately stops there -- the tooling is each agent's own to build on top
# of those facts, so nothing here points at a recipe.
